    "solution": "Step 1: By the Remote Interior Angles Theorem, \\(\\text{Exterior Angle} = \\text{Sum of Remote Interior Angles}\\).\nStep 2: \\(110^\\circ = 40^\\circ + \\angle B \\implies \\angle B = 110^\\circ - 40^\\circ\\).\nStep 3: \\(\\angle B = 70^\\circ\\).",
