    "solution": "Step 1: By the Isosceles Triangle Theorem, angles opposite to equal sides are equal: \\(\\angle Q = \\angle R\\).\nStep 2: Sum of angles = \\(180^\\circ \\implies 70^\\circ + 2\\angle Q = 180^\\circ\\).\nStep 3: \\(2\\angle Q = 180^\\circ - 70^\\circ = 110^\\circ \\implies \\angle Q = 55^\\circ\\).",
