    "questionCode": "MH-9-MTH2-4-4.1.1-OSC-156",
    "text": "In constructing \\(\\triangle ABC\\) given base \\(BC\\), \\(\\angle B\\), and sum of sides \\(AB + AC\\), what geometric line is drawn to locate vertex \\(A\\) on ray \\(BD\\)?",
